  "details": "yeah, pretty self explanatory; i'm left handed, which means i use the arrow keys to move around in games (usually at least), and i am not able to use wasd controls cause, yeah, i cant use my mouse with my right hand in the same way i cant write with it, what i'm asking for is just, an option to change keybindings, basically every game has one, and vr chat doesnt, which is basically blocking any left handed person that isnt ambidextrous, from, y'know, being able to play the game.\nIn conclusion, pepehands to us lefties, do something pls thx.",
